agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/acceptance/release/runs/A4-formal-20260901-0808/returns/state-integrity.md:20:The first independent restart probe used an overstrict reviewer assertion that the entire archive file remain byte-identical. It exited `1` because replay intentionally persists only `replayed: false -> true`. Inspection confirmed that `archive_digest_sha256` excludes `replayed`; the archive body and digest remained stable and both topic-state files remained byte-identical. The corrected probe exited `0`. This was a probe defect, not an implementation finding.
