agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/acceptance/release/runs/A4-formal-20260901-0808/returns/state-integrity.md:98:The initial combined probe exited `1` solely on the overstrict whole-archive byte assertion; its other five negative probes passed. The corrected restart-only command exited `0` with `PASS restart replay: replayed=false->true; archive body/digest stable; both topic-state files byte-stable`.
